//CABING7R JOB (CABS,INGST),'A.BUKOWSKI',CLASS=B,MSGCLASS=X,
//             MSGLEVEL=(1,1),NOTIFY=&SYSUID,
//             REGION=4M,TIME=(5,0)
//*****************************************************************
//* CABING7R - STANDALONE RERUN OF CABING07 (SUSPENSE            *
//* CONSOLIDATION AND AUDIT LOGGING).  AUDLOG IS EXTEND - A       *
//* RERUN ADDS ANOTHER 3-RECORD BLOCK TO THE SAME AUDIT TRAIL,    *
//* IT DOES NOT REPLACE THE FAILED ATTEMPT'S RECORDS.             *
//*****************************************************************
//*
//* TYPICAL TRIGGER: THE PRINTED EXCEPTION REPORT FROM THE
//* MAIN STREAM'S STEP130 DID NOT PRINT (SPOOL FULL, PRINTER
//* DOWN) BUT THE CONSOLIDATION ITSELF SUCCEEDED - RERUNNING
//* JUST REPRINTS.  IF THE CONSOLIDATION ITSELF FAILED, CHECK
//* THE SEVERITY BREAKOUT COUNTS IN THE PRIOR ATTEMPT'S CTLOUT
//* RECORD BEFORE RESUBMITTING - A HIGH FATAL COUNT USUALLY
//* MEANS THE UPSTREAM SUSPENSE FEED ITSELF IS THE PROBLEM,
//* NOT THIS STEP.
//*
//* NO COND ON THIS JOB - CABING07 IS DESIGNED TO BE SAFE TO
//* RUN MULTIPLE TIMES AGAINST THE SAME SUSPENSE GENERATION;
//* EACH RUN PRODUCES ITS OWN NEW SUSOUT AND CTLOUT GENERATION
//* AND APPENDS ITS OWN THREE RECORDS TO AUDLOG.
//*
//*
//STEP010  EXEC CABPSUSP,CYCLE=&CYCLE,RUNID=&RUNID,MODE=&RERUN
//STEP010.SUSIN   DD DSN=TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.SUSPENSE(0),DISP=SHR
//
